3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12600K (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI’m trying to create a dialog box using a RichText label. The main reason is to be able to be sure that each line appears properly without jumping a word from one line to the next if it doesn’t fit. I do that by setting “Visible Characters Behavior” to “Characters After Shaping”. I want to use this in conjunction the “Visible Ratio”, starting it at 0 and then using a tween to show the message. To let the text scroll as the text starts appearing I also enable the “Scroll Following”.\n\nThe problem arises when I see that the text starts already scrolled to the bottom, making like the text is always hidden, until it reaches the last sentence.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1803367c-9480-4d91-b78f-99da99afd2d6)\n\nI tried setting the scroll value to 0 in GDScript, and also using the method scroll_to_line(). They do scroll to the start of the text, but making this somehow makes the auto scrolling not work. Notice how the scroll jumps back to the top here;\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2bc43198-bbf7-4bf5-806d-930c8d7896a8)\n\nOf couse, if I set the “Visible Characters Behaviour” back to \"“Characters Before Shaping”, the scroll works correctly and starts from the beginning, but as I mentioned, the sentence’s words jump from one line to the next if they don’t fit.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3d04048-f091-41ad-9d56-e30b39ec893b)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1) To recreate this behavior, first create a RichText node.\n2) Add some text in the inspector or assign it in code. Long enough to have multiple lines.\n3) Set the \"Visible Characters Behavior\" to \"Characters After Shaping\"\n4) Set the \"Visible Ratio\" to 0\n5) Enable \"Scroll Following\"\n6) Set a tween to move the visible ratio to 1\n\n```gdscript \nvar read_text_animation = create_tween()\nread_text_animation.tween_property(%RichText, \"visible_ratio\", 1, 4)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[RichText.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19504846/RichText.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104722/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104722/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}